"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5226490","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4644350-1845383656397657","game_id":"steam-4644350","kind":"announcement","title":"Astromino's soundtrack is now available on all kinds of music platforms!","summary":"man! I dunno... look, I know I'm biased, but I really enjoy Astromino's soundtrack! I legit have a couple of it's songs in my regular playlists. so I did the little bitta' extra work to get it published to a bunch of music-y platforms - you know, Spotify, and YouTube Music, and all that.if you also like Astromino's soundtrack, here are some links. I think you should totally play the songs at, um, your next big party... and tell everyone how cool Astromino is... but... I dunno, look: I might be b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T21:45:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397657","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4644350-1842212951308203","game_id":"steam-4644350","kind":"announcement","title":"Endless Mode tweaks & fixes, achievements, alternate hero outfits, and more!","summary":"achievements... 14 of them!achievements the game knows you already qualify for are awarded retroactively when starting up the game, however a few things were never logged (like clearing 5 rows with the drop of a single piece), so you'll have to re-perform those feats to get the achievements - sorry!endless Mode (& related) changesin Endless Mode, there's now fewer nodes to visit overall - in particular, there's one fewer shop and treasure nodewhen choosing a treasure reward in Endless Mode, the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T18:12:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951308203","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4644350-1840944183784148","game_id":"steam-4644350","kind":"announcement","title":"visual updates to many screens, two new songs, and: a new Endless Mode","summary":"many thanks to all the people play-testing these early builds! while this is not the final update before the public \"version 1\" release, the updates leading up to that point will likely to be polish updates (which this update also includes a lot of). translation fixes, performance improvements, stability updates... that kind of thing. that said, you never know: maybe I'll get inspired to add some new hero 🤷‍♀️ and depending on how well the game sells, maybe I'll make be making updates for years ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T16:00:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183784148","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4644350-1837955055361400","game_id":"steam-4644350","kind":"announcement","title":"bugfixes, text clarifications, and some little visual tweaks","summary":"the couple gameplay tweaksx2 damage stamps now cost 1 more money compared to other stampswhen a player has Somatic Chit, garbage floor-type enemies no longer create rows that should (but fail to) immediately clearreducing confusionreplaced all usage of the term \"soft drop\" with more widely-understood textwhen a dialog is open, content outside the dialog is now dimmedchanged the look of \"choose one\"-type buttons (for example, language selection and graphics scaling/zoom selection)you can now pres","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T15:45:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055361400","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4644350-1836506165564111","game_id":"steam-4644350","kind":"announcement","title":"a new feature at the shop, a couple new relics, and...","summary":"this is largely a polish update, filling in missing graphics, adding new graphics, adding new sounds, etc. that said, the shop has a new service on offer, and a couple new relics were added.shopyou can now pay to remove a piece from your bagyour character now appears in the shop... as do new shop keepers - there are three, one per sectorshop tooltips are no longer obscured by your character's title or on-hand moneyrelicsas mentioned: there's a couple more :P (you'll have to discover them for you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T02:43:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165564111","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4644350-1836506165544649","game_id":"steam-4644350","kind":"announcement","title":"beta build for music-cued visuals is available","summary":"I took ~1 week off Astromino development, but I'm back! :)I've got the beginnings of a new system that cues visual effects based on music, because music is rad! but because it might not be stable, especially for Mac users, I'm publishing it as a \"beta\" build in Steam.you need a secret code to access the beta builds, SO: if you'd like access to the beta build, get in touch - all you early players know where to find me!once it's proven not to crash, I'll release a more-complete version of the upda","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T02:01:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165544649","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4644350-1834602721200243","game_id":"steam-4644350","kind":"announcement","title":"two new heroes, changes to Ansa & Meliono, new relics, and more!","summary":"⚠ As the game is still in pre-release, I do not try too hard to retain backwards compatibility with old save data - your progress may be lost after starting this update!Hero changesMeliono has gained Ansa's bag of pentominoes (in addition to his previous passive abilities)Ansa now has a normal bag of tetrominoes; she can no longer see upcoming pieces, or even the pieces which remain in her bagTwo new heroes have been added, who I will not spoil for you here!Meliono & Lorlea got some small tweaks","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T21:45:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721200243","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4644350-1833968530886577","game_id":"steam-4644350","kind":"announcement","title":"new enemies, new bosses, new music, and more!","summary":"New contentNew monster: Lernamaw — a regenerating beast that heals 1 HP every half-secondNew monster: Sednan Urchin + Messy Floor modifier — bottom 2 rows start pre-filled with garbage, Coin spaces shifted up.New boss: Nova Remnant — a red-tinted column burns away every 4 pieces you place. The column shows a countdown, and warns you in pink when the next placement triggers the wipe.3 new songs: \"9.26 Kelvin\", \"Where?\", and \"No Great Filters\".More starting music — new runs now begin with three so","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-27T21:58:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530886577","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4644350-1832700592800051","game_id":"steam-4644350","kind":"update","title":"a little update","summary":"The TravelerThe Traveler character now gets their Supernova relic when entering the first sector map, instead of just having ittweaked the Supernova relic help textEncounterswhen a really big piece locks in place, the whole grid shakesthat drooling lizard graphic is a little smallertwo bosses have gained graphics (one could use some work, but you know)all enemy graphics are now fully visible, instead of, like, 1/4 off the edge of the screenthat encounter tutorial text that told you to get $? non","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-19T04:32:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592800051","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4644350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4644350":"2026-10-26T13:16:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4644350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:15Z"},"5226490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:16Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4644350","app_id":4644350,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:45Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"ae437fd07d315b36752af625d0884948e69e8cf218c4434